# Checkbox Format Tests
## Standard Format
- [ ] unchecked item
- [x] checked item
- [X] checked with capital X

## Flexible Spacing
- [x ] checked with space after x
- [ x] checked with space before x
- [  ] unchecked with extra space
- [xx] double x (should be checked)

## Plain Format
- plain item without checkbox
- another plain item
- third plain item

## Mixed Formats
- [ ] standard unchecked
- [x] standard checked
- [X ] capital X with space
- [ x] space before lowercase x
- plain item mixed in
- [x] back to standard

# Edge Cases
## Empty and Whitespace
- [ ]
- [x]
- [ ]    item with leading spaces
- [x]	item with tab

## Special Characters
- [ ] item with "quotes"
- [x] item with 'apostrophes'
- [ ] item with #hashtag
- [x] item with @ symbol
- [ ] item with % & * symbols

# Real Examples
## Development Tasks
- [x ] implement parser flexibility
- [ x] add validation tests
- [X] update documentation
- [ ] write unit tests
- plain todo without checkbox
- [x] final checked item
